Ordered by decision value per unit of risk. All E0 items are strictly read-only.

### E0 — Targeted read-only capture (~10 minutes, no state change)

Run from an interactive `adb shell` with `su`:

```sh
# RAM budget. NOTE: MemAvailable does not exist before Linux 3.14.
su -c 'cat /proc/meminfo'
su -c 'busybox free'

# Loop devices and the SD block node
su -c 'ls -l /dev/block/loop* /dev/block/vold/179:1'
